<Ui xmlns="http://www.blizzard.com/wow/ui/">
<!-- LibItemDB v1.12.0 (MIT, by Pimptasty), cut down to where an item is sold and for how much, with
     Forever's own data: ItemPlaces is Vanilla's filtered to Forever's items plus the vendors Forever's
     client lists, VendorPrices Forever's. ItemPlacesLearned (places its author's players saw in game)
     must load after ItemPlaces: it reuses that file's creatures. PlaceNames (vendor names per
     language, each file loads only on its own client) ship no ptBR one. To update: replace
     LibItemDB-1.0.lua and these files from the new release's Data\Forever, then run
     dev/vendorstacks.js: prices here are for a merchant's stack. -->
<Script file="LibItemDB-1.0.lua"/>
<Script file="Data\Forever\_core\ItemPlaces.lua"/>
<Script file="Data\Forever\_core\ItemPlacesLearned.lua"/>
<Script file="Data\Forever\_core\VendorPrices.lua"/>
